Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.83,1:08:24.88,Default1,,0,0,0,,(我是谁)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.34,1:08:35.94,Default1,,0,0,0,,(蛛网液)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.36,1:12:05.16,Default1,,0,0,0,,(斯塔顿岛)
