Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.98,1:54:11.82,Default1,,0,0,0,,(找到会飞秃鹫男一个 蜘蛛侠 飞机的事抱歉了)
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.20,1:54:32.58,Default1,,0,0,0,,(返校日舞会)
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.09,1:56:37.55,Default1,,0,0,0,,(未知号码 去厕所)
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.75,1:57:54.89,Default1,,0,0,0,,(奥迪人工智能启动 可以脱手)
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.89,2:02:29.36,Default1,,0,0,0,,(物归原主 托尼·斯塔克)
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.41,2:13:04.50,Default1,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠将回归
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界要变样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are never gonna be the same now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.47,0:00:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,画了外星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.70,0:00:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还有绿色的大块头把楼砸坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got big green guys tearing down buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我小时候 画的都是牛仔和印第安人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a kid, I used to draw cowboys and Indians.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 得叫美国土著 无所谓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, it's native American, but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 不过 告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Tell you what, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还不赖 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't bad, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子有前途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid's got a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll see, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那玩意锯不断的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't saw through that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这些外星玩意很结实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These alien bastards are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你得用他们的东西对付他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta use the stuff they use.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.58,0:01:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴你能来啊 下午好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad you could join us. Afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我的闹钟没响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. My alarm didn't go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:01:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你的闹钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, your alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:02:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,照我说的把那个装甲板摞起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, just go stack that armor plating like I asked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是个大单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a huge deal for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.77,0:02:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,依照行政命令396b\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In accordance with executive order 396b,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所有战后清理工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all post-battle cleanup operations
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,均由我们接管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are now under our jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你们的服务 我们会接手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for your service. We'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.45,0:02:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有资质人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Qualified personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.52,0:02:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我跟市政府签了合同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I have a city contract
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.90,0:02:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,清理废墟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to salvage all this, okay, with the city, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 图姆斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologize, Mr. Toomes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但一切清理行动现在都由我们负责了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but all salvage operations are now under our jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,请交出全部你们已收集的外星物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please turn over any and all exotic materials that you've collected
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,否则你们将被起诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you will be prosecuted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,女士 什么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, what am...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 过来 女士 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Come here. Hey, lady, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我为这单活儿买了卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bought trucks for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我还招了新人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought in a whole new crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人都有家室 我也有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys have a family. I have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.33,0:02:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我赌上了一切 我可能丢掉房子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all in on this. I could lose my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 我也没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir. There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,或许下次 别不自量力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe next time, don't overextend yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:02:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:02:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他是对的 我不自量力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right. I overextended myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,都放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你有不满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you have a grievance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以去找我的上级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you may take it up with my superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的上级 那是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your superiors. Who the hell are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克工业和联邦政府的合营企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A joint venture between Stark Industries and the federal government,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,损害控制局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Department of Damage Control,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,将监督外星和其他外来物质的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will oversee the collection and storage of alien
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,收集和存储\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and other exotic materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那个搞出烂摊子的混蛋现在又要收钱收拾残局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the assholes who made this mess are paid to clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 都是内部交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's all rigged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,据专家估计 整个三州地区散落了超过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Experts estimate there are over 1500 tons of exotic material
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.59,0:03:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,1500吨的外来物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scattered throughout the tri-state area.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有一车昨天的货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still have another load from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得上交的 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're supposed to turn this in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可不去送 - 太可惜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I ain't hauling it. - It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以用那些外星玩意做不少好玩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could have made some cool stuff from all that alien junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.30,0:03:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不交了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界在变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也该变变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time we change too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,给 梅森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go, Mason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,生意很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Business is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约市 皇后区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York. Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这一带不太平 但终归是家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a rough borough, but, hey, it's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你在跟谁说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没谁 我在拍摄行程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one. Just making a little video of the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不能拿给任何人看 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't show it to anyone. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那你还变声念旁白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why are you narrating in that voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好玩嘛 - 好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because it's fun. - Fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么叫哈皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why do they call you Happy?
