Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就坐那儿吗 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that where you're gonna sit? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你第一次做专机吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your first time on a private plane?
