Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 箱子呢 - 什么箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the case? - What case?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我的... 什么 我以为那是个橱柜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not my... What? I thought that was a closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里也是我的房间吗 - 快去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is still my room? - Go. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.51,0:06:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的房间好大... - 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My room is way bigger than... - There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到箱子了 我找到箱子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found the case. I found the case. I found the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"稍作升级"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A minor upgrade"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 穿上 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put it on. - What the...?
