Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - But I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给我的吗 哈皮 哈皮 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it for me? Happy. Happy, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了 太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is insane. Insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.97,0:07:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个啊 看看这眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this thing. Look. Look at the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是我人生最棒的一天 - 快点换吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The greatest day of my life. - Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 那是美国队长 钢铁侠 黑寡妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, there's Captain America, Iron Man, Black Widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.17,0:07:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个新来的是谁 - 内衣宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's that new guy? - Underoos!
