Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 刚刚太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so the craziest thing just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟美国队长打了一架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just had a fight with Captain America.
