Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,简直太赞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the most amazing thing that ever happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生喊 "内衣宝宝"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark was like, "Hey, underoos!"
