Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then... hey, just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,墙不太隔音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have thin walls here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么呢 做视频日志吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing, a little video diary?
