Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 换了我也会的 - 我叫他别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd do the same thing. - I told him not to.
