Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 到镜头里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure. - Get in the frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.10,0:08:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
