Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.15,0:08:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿着什么呢 希望是布料少的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you wearing? Something skimpy, I hope.
