Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一 你好啊 梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, two, one. Hey, may.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 我想告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My gosh, I wanted to tell you
