Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.01,0:08:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,并道啊 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a freaking merge. Sorry.
