Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 他是不是拼命打呼噜来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, seriously, was he snoring a bunch?
