Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别给他太多压力 别干蠢事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't stress him out. Don't do anything stupid.
