Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这之间有一小块灰色区域 就是你的活动范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a little gray area in there. And that's where you operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我是个复仇者了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, does that mean I'm an avenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个吗 - 七楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This it? - Seventh floor.
