Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你自己拿啊 - 嗯 我自己拿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna take it? - Yeah, I can take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们下次什么时候...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when's our next...?
