Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.95,0:09:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们会联络你的 - 你有我的号码吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll call you. - Do you have my numbers?
