Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,３８０３\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three thousand eight hundred and three.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.87,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不可思议 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's insane. - I know.
