Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,角正弦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the product of sine of the angle
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,乘重力除质量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gravity divided by the mass.
