Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,质量抵消了 就是重力乘正弦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mass cancels out, so it's just gravity times sine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对 瞧 弗拉士 如果答错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. See, Flash, being the fastest
