Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,铀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uranium.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,正确 谢谢 亚伯拉罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is correct. Thank you, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 请将书打开到第10页\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Open your books to page 10.
