Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁的自行车 没人认吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this anybody's bike? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哥们 这是你的自行车吗 - 没零钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, buddy, is this your bike? - I have no change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谁有笔吗 你有笔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does anyone have a pen? Do you have a pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你是油管上那个蜘蛛男 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're that spider guy on YouTube, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我蜘蛛侠啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me spider-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 蜘蛛侠 翻个身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, spider-man. Do a flip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别偷车 这可不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't steal cars, it's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的车 蠢蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my car, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut that off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能不能告诉他这是我的车 - 我就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you tell him it's my car? - I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我还上夜班呢 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work at nights. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是你的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not your car!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是他的车 - 我怎么能知道是他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's his car. - How was I supposed to know it's his car?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他还撬窗 - 每天都这么吵吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He put that in the window! - Every day with these damn alarms!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 关掉 - 别逼我下去收拾你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Turn it off! - Don't make me come down there, you punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.89,0:17:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,加里 你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Gary! How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,玛乔莉 你好吗 你妈妈好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marjorie, how are you? How's your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,已为您接入语音信箱 收件人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have reached the voicemail box of:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哈皮·霍根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy Hogan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哈皮 跟你报告下今天的战绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, happy. Here's my report for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我拦截了一个自行车大盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stopped a grand theft bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但没找到车主 就留了张字条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't find the owner, so I just left a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我还帮助了一位迷路的多米尼加老太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I helped this lost, old Dominican lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.39,0:18:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她很客气 还给我买了个西班牙油条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was really nice and bought me a churro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是觉得 我还能做到更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just feel like I could be doing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是想知道下次任务会是什么时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know? Just curious when the next real mission's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 那打给我哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, yeah, just call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我是彼得 帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Peter. Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛把油条的事说出来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I tell him about the churro?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真等不及看看它的威力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't wait to see this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可算有动真格的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally, something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.50,0:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有这高科技的玩意简直太轻松了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, this high-tech stuff makes it too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就说这个值吧 - 快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Told you it was worth it. - Okay, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.53,0:19:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今晚还能再劫五个网点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can hit, like, five more places tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,几位好啊 这是忘记卡号了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up, guys? You forget your pin number?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是复仇者诶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the Avengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,托尔 绿巨人 可算见到你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor. Hulk. Good to finally meet you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你们本人会更帅些呢 钢铁侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you'd be more handsome in person. Iron man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你抢银行干什么 你是亿万富翁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what are you doing robbing a bank? You're a billionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.65,0:19:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好怪啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This feels so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.87,0:19:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始... 觉得...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starting... to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不是... 复仇者了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not... The Avengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,911 有什么紧急情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}911. What's your emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠在大战复仇者联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-man is fighting the Avengers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.82,0:20:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就在21街的一家银行里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a bank on 21st street.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.80,0:20:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位 我们做个了结吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys, let's wrap this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,明天还上学呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a school night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样的混混哪弄来这样的装备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how do jerks like you get tech like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,达尔摩先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Delmar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.77,0:20:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,达尔摩先生 你在吗 有人在吗 有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Delmar, you in here? Is anybody in here? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我得...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- here, here. - Good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.57,0:20:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Good. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别别 放下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes... no. No, put that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那可比你我都值钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's worth more than you or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:20:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哈皮 我刚碰到了特别疯狂的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy, the craziest thing just happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有群人拿着高科技的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys were robbing an ATM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,打劫了一个自动提款机网点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with high-tech weapons...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢说 我没工夫管小打小闹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a breath. I don't have time for ATM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 劫匪 - 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- robberies - Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你体贴的留言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the thoughtful notes you leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我还得操心搬家的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have moving day to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,下周前所有东西都得搬走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's gotta be out by next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 搬家 谁要搬家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait. You're moving? Who's moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.49,0:21:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你不看新闻吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, don't you watch the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼卖了复仇者大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony sold Avengers Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.85,0:21:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将迁至州北的新设施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're relocating to a new facility upstate
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,希望 那里的手机信号要烂一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where hopefully the cell service is much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我呢 - 你怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But what about me? - What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那要是斯塔克先生需要我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what if Mr. Stark needs me or something
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,或是发生了什么大事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I don't know, something big goes down?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能让我跟斯塔克先生谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, can I please just talk to Mr. Stark?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别干什么太危险的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, just stay away from anything too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我要负责确保你会负责行事 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm responsible for making sure you're responsible, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我很负责的 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am responsible. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.23,0:21:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的背包没了 - 那不像负责的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My backpack's gone. - That doesn't sound responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我再打给你吧 - 不打也行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll call you back. - Feel free not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.02,0:22:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,什么声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你是蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the spider-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 油管上那个 - 我不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- From YouTube. - I'm not. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚刚趴在天花板上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were on the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.42,0:22:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有... 你为什么在我房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I wasn't... Man, what are you doing in my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:22:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,梅让我进来的 我们说好一起做完死星的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May let me in. You said we were gonna finish the Death Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.77,0:23:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能就这么闯进我的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't just bust into my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.15,0:23:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那个火鸡肉卷的菜谱太烂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That Turkey meatloaf recipe is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.31,0:23:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出去吃吧 泰国菜行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to dinner. Thai?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 吃泰国菜吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, you want thai?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.05,0:23:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 不好 他还有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - No. He's got a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.49,0:23:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,之后再做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thing to do after.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.44,0:23:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.92,0:23:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上点衣服吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe put on some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她还不知道吗 - 谁都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She doesn't know? - Nobody knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.67,0:23:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生知道 因为他给我做了战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, Mr. Stark knows because he made my suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但没别人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那是托尼·斯塔克做的 你是复仇者吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony Stark made you that? Are you an Avenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.62,0:23:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 差不多吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 你不能告诉任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, geez. - You can't tell anybody about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.13,0:23:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你得保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 秘密 为什么 - 你知道她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Secret? Why? - You know what she's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,她要是知道我每晚都被人追杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she finds out people try and kill me every single night,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.93,0:23:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她就不会允许我再做下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's not gonna let me do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了 内德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Ned, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.81,0:23:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.07,0:23:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll level with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.88,0:23:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我保不了密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I can't keep this a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.91,0:23:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我遇到过的最棒的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the greatest thing that's ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.19,0:23:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 梅绝不能知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, May cannot know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在不能让她那样担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot do that to her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.69,0:23:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.80,0:23:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她经受了那么多事 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, everything that's happened with her, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.75,0:23:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.83,0:23:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 发誓 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Just swear it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:23:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.26,0:24:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.31,0:24:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this is happening now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.39,0:24:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能试试战衣吗 - 不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I try the suit on? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.53,0:24:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,它是什么原理 磁铁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it work? Is it magnets?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.59,0:24:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那些线你怎么射出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you shoot the strings?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.65,0:24:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明天到学校跟你讲 好吗 - 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna tell you about this at school tomorrow, okay? - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.20,0:24:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, well, wait, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.37,0:24:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么同时做这个和斯塔克的实习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do this and the Stark internship?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是斯塔克的实习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Stark internship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.36,0:24:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.18,0:24:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是喜欢肉沙拉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you loved larb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.30,0:24:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,太腻了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too larby?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.22,0:24:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不够腻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not larby enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.02,0:24:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你还要我说几次"腻"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times do I have to say "larb" before...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.11,0:24:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,才肯跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.99,0:24:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我爱腻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I larb you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.10,0:24:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是压力大 实习让我好累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just stressed. The internship, and I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.40,0:24:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,很忙碌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.60,0:24:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克的实习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Stark internship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.86,0:24:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你说 我可不怎么喜欢那个托尼·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to tell you, not a fan of that Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.68,0:24:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是一心多用 他搞得你心神不宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're distracted all the time. He's got you in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.26,0:24:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 深受喜爱的皇后区达尔摩三明治店 - 他都叫你做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- the beloved Queens institution Delmar Sandwiches - What does he have you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:25:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在今晚早些时候的一场爆炸中被毁 - 你得相信直觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- was destroyed in an explosion earlier tonight - You need to use your instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.28,0:25:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸起因是一场被挫败的自动提款机抢劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after an ATM robbery was thwarted
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.25,0:25:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而见义勇为的正是皇后区本地的犯罪终结者 - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- by Queens' own colorful local crime stopper, - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.03,0:25:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Spider-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.48,0:25:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠在阻止他们抢劫的过程中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the Spider-man attempted to foil their heist,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.84,0:25:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一股强大的冲击波被触发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a powerful blast was set off,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.54,0:25:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,结果切碎了街对面的小店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}slicing through the bodega across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.85,0:25:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,奇迹的是 没人受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miraculously, no one was harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.03,0:25:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是看到了这样的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you spot something like that happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.02,0:25:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻调头就跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you turn and you run the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.22,0:25:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.06,0:25:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,离我们就六个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six blocks away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.74,0:25:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要新背包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a new backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.01,0:25:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我需要新背包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I need a new backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.59,0:25:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这都第五个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's five.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.08,0:25:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 糯米布丁 - 我们没点那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sticky rice pudding. - We didn't order that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.59,0:25:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,请你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.48,0:25:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.31,0:25:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他真好心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.70,0:25:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他喜欢腻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he larbs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.71,0:25:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你被一只蜘蛛咬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got bit by a spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.42,0:25:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,能让它咬咬我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can it bite me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.26,0:25:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大概挺疼的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it probably would've hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.21,0:25:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 就算真疼 我也忍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever. Even if it did hurt, I'd let it bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.66,0:25:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,或许吧 到底多疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe. How much did it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.61,0:25:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那只蜘蛛死了 内德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spider's dead, Ned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.21,0:26:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.65,0:26:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.03,0:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能会没命呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've died.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.77,0:26:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你下蛋吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you lay eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.50,0:26:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.55,0:26:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能吐毒液吗 - 不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you spit venom? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.52,0:26:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你能召唤一支蜘蛛大军出来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you summon an army of spiders?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.12,0:26:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不能 内德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Ned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.10,0:26:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,《索科威亚协议》的签订\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sokovia Accords were put into place...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.31,0:26:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的网能射多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far can you shoot your webs?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.83,0:26:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没试过 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unknown. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.21,0:26:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,开始管理...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to begin regulating...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.56,0:26:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是你 就站在一栋建筑边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I was you, I would stand on the edge of a building
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.12,0:26:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尽量往远了射 - 闭嘴啦 内德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and shoot as far as I could... - Shut up, Ned.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.55,0:26:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好 我是美国队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Captain America.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.94,0:26:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你是在课堂里 还是战场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether you're in the classroom or on the battlefield...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.40,0:26:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还认识他吗 - 嗯 我们见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know him too? - Yeah, we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.73,0:26:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我偷了他的盾 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I stole his shield. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.40,0:26:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 我的好朋友 你们的体育老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, my good friend, your gym teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.52,0:26:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,将带大家进行美国队长健身挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be conducting the Captain America Fitness Challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.45,0:26:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.61,0:27:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙按说现在是战犯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty sure this guy's a war criminal now,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.90,0:27:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但管他呢 我必须给你们看视频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but whatever, I have to show these videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.10,0:27:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是州的要求 我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's required by the state. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.06,0:27:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇者还要缴税吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do Avengers have to pay taxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.95,0:27:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,绿巨人什么味儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does Hulk smell like?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.63,0:27:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯定香香的 - 闭嘴吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I bet he smells nice. - You have to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.68,0:27:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,美国队长人挺好吗 还是坏脾气老头那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Captain America cool, or is he like a mean, old grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.65,0:27:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 别说了 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, just shh, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.65,0:27:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做你的技术支援吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I be your guy in the chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.56,0:27:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.30,0:27:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个戴着耳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You know how there's a guy with a headset
