Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.22,0:28:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,威尔森教练还是美国队长的"好朋友"呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, like Coach Wilson and Captain America are friends.
