Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.01,0:28:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开派对吗 - 是啊 会很赞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Having a party? - Yeah, it's gonna be dope.
