Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.81,0:29:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们去吧 - 嗯 我们去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We should go to the party. - Yeah, let's do it.
