Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.15,0:32:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,给 你试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. You try.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.21,0:32:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 我只想要点低调的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I wanted something low-key.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.17,0:32:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你干吗卖我这些高档货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you trying to upsell me, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.48,0:32:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我有符合你要求的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay. I got what you need, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.75,0:32:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我这里有一堆好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got tons of great stuff here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.23,0:32:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.26,0:32:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我有黑洞手榴弹 齐塔瑞磁轨炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I got black hole grenades, Chitauri railguns...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在野外乱开火了 快点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You letting off shots in public now? Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.07,0:32:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,时代变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, times are changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.70,0:32:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我们卖这些个高科技武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the only ones selling these high-tech weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,自动提款机劫匪肯定就从他们这儿买的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This must be where the ATM robbers got their stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.91,0:32:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想要打劫的家伙事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need something to stick up somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.97,0:33:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想把他们打回到过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not trying to shoot them back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.84,0:33:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我有反重力攀爬器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got antigrav climbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.22,0:33:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,攀爬器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, climbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.99,0:33:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, what the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.69,0:33:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是你布的局吗 - 冷静 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you set us up? - Hey, hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.97,0:33:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂 你想开枪 就冲我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You gonna shoot at somebody, shoot at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.88,0:33:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.57,0:33:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.82,0:33:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得联系他 - 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We gotta call him. - No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.59,0:33:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你又乱开火了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.20,0:34:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 我要打给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up. - I'm calling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,图姆斯电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toomes's phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.37,0:34:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.20,0:34:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.01,0:34:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这可好 那我得走捷径了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Guess I'm gonna have to take a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.39,0:34:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,两位 打得好 玩得开心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys. Good game. Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.79,0:34:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,乖狗狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.19,0:34:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 没工夫玩 去捡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, no time to play. Here, go fetch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.40,0:34:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这才像话嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.27,0:35:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好香\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smells really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.30,0:35:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这电影真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.81,0:35:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.84,0:35:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我是彼得 请留言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's Peter. Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.47,0:35:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得 你去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.10,0:35:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,帽子没给我加分 你这样可不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hat's not working. This is not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.08,0:35:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,差一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.33,0:35:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,以为你甩掉我了 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you got away from me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.22,0:35:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我早料到你会到这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you right where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.68,0:35:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,惊不惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.41,0:35:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.53,0:36:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他像个怪物似的一个猛子扎下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he just, like, swooped down like a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.15,0:36:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,抱起了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and picked me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.25,0:36:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,带我飞了好高 然后又把我丢了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and took me up like a thousand feet and just dropped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.80,0:36:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.47,0:36:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你在我的战衣上装了追踪器吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you put a tracker in my suit or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.18,0:36:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我在你的战衣上什么都装了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put everything in your suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.43,0:37:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,包括这个加热器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including this heater.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.06,0:37:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服多了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's better. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.72,0:37:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么想的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.82,0:37:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那个带翅膀的男人显然是武器的源头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy with wings is obviously the source of the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.98,0:37:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我得拿下他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.25,0:37:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还拿下他呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him down now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.25,0:37:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别冲动 这种事是有专人负责管的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady Crockett, there are people who handle this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.19,0:37:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 复仇者吗 - 不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Avengers? - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.84,0:37:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事不值得他们出手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a little below their pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.96,0:37:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 斯塔克先生 您不必大老远赶来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, Mr. Stark, you didn't have to come all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.36,0:37:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚能搞定的 我没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had that. I was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.50,0:37:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我没赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.30,0:37:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好这地方有无线网络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank god this place has Wi-Fi
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.34,0:37:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,否则你现在就死翘翘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you would be toast right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.14,0:37:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便也感谢象鼻神吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank Ganesh while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.57,0:37:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.22,0:37:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你别管那个会飞的秃鹫男了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, forget the flying vulture guy, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.70,0:37:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 还为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.56,0:37:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I said so!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.16,0:37:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 教训小孩子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I'm talking to a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.17,0:37:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,脚踏实地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.75,0:37:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,先帮助小人物 循序渐进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Build up your game helping the little people,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.95,0:37:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,比如那个给你买油条的老太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like that lady that bought you the churro.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.57,0:37:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能就做个友善的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you just be a friendly
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.12,0:37:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好街坊蜘蛛侠吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}neighborhood Spider-man?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.51,0:37:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但我现在已经准备好承担更多责任了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm ready for more than that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.95,0:37:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.01,0:38:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我迎战美国队长时 你可不是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not what you thought when I took on Captain America.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.37,0:38:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.32,0:38:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,要是美队真想打趴你 他是做得到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If cap wanted to lay you out, he would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.56,0:38:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.41,0:38:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是再碰到这些武器 联系哈皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you come across these weapons again, call Happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.22,0:38:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.75,0:38:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑大学的事永远不嫌早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's never too early to start thinking about college.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.04,0:38:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我在麻省理工有关系 结束通话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got some pull at MIT. End call.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.36,0:38:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不需要去大学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't need to go to col...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.52,0:38:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯塔克先生 - 斯塔克先生已断线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Stark. - Mr. Stark is no longer connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.59,0:38:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这可好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.00,0:38:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"脚踏实地" 他说什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Stay close to the ground"? What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.61,0:38:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 怎么了 我正要回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, what's up? I'm on my way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.09,0:38:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 我是打来告诉你 你还是别来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I was calling to say maybe you shouldn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.52,0:38:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大家听着 - 听啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everyone. - Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.46,0:38:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我说"软蛋" 你们说"帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I say "Penis," you say "Parker."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.05,0:38:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 软蛋 - 帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Penis! - Parker!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.38,0:39:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 软蛋 - 帕克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Penis! - Parker!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.96,0:39:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 彼得 看来我们还是那么可悲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Peter. I guess we're still losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.42,0:39:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,明天见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.16,0:39:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,明天学校见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you tomorrow in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.49,0:39:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.06,0:39:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.05,0:39:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.80,0:39:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,老大 你老婆一直在给你发短信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss? Your wife keeps texting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.19,0:39:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么刹车灯的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something about a brake light.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.75,0:39:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是叫你别看我的手机吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd I tell you about looking at my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你就搁在这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. You left it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.42,0:40:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我这人天生好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm a curious person by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.25,0:40:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我设计好那个高空真空密封装置了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I finished designing that high-altitude vacuum seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.53,0:40:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想... 干票大的的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case you want to, you know, go for the big one?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.74,0:40:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在研究那个 我说不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still on that? I told you, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.97,0:40:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的 别想了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer's no. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.18,0:40:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚太帅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that was badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.21,0:40:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说多少次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times have I told you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.49,0:40:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,别在外面乱开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to fire them out in the open?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.26,0:40:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你叫我卖掉货的 - 低调卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said, move the merchandise. - Under the radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.08,0:40:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,低调卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under the radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.20,0:40:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们才能生存下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.48,0:40:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是招来了损害控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you bring Damage Control
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.04,0:40:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,或是复仇者 我们就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the Avengers down here, we're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.28,0:40:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你在外面 戴着那个傻兮兮的玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out there wearing that goofy thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.15,0:40:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,到处炸车 还自称"惊悚"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lighting up cars calling yourself the Shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.12,0:40:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我是惊悚 我以惊制人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm the shocker. I shock people."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.07,0:40:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这是职业摔跤吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this, pro wrestling?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.35,0:40:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,随你说吧 老头子 行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever, old man. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.66,0:40:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.33,0:41:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.83,0:41:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么都不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you don't give a crap about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.75,0:41:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但我在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.59,0:41:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我建立这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I built this whole place
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.79,0:41:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了照顾我要照顾的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I got people I have to look after.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.71,0:41:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.24,0:41:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.84,0:41:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我受不起你的胡闹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't afford your bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 滚 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out of here. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.24,0:41:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你完了 你被踢出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're done. You're off the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.93,0:41:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.48,0:41:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.54,0:41:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但你赶我出去能放心吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonder if you can afford me out there, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.27,0:41:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那么多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.05,0:41:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.90,0:41:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是说 或许你妻子会想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just saying, maybe your wife would like to know
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.61,0:41:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你的钱究竟是哪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where you really get your money from.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.57,0:41:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道吗 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.64,0:41:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.05,0:41:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个好使吗 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That work? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.75,0:41:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't afford that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.21,0:41:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}W-w-wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.62,0:41:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.71,0:42:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是反重力枪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought this was the antigravity gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.57,0:42:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 不 那个才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No, that's that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.92,0:42:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.05,0:42:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你是惊悚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're the shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.31,0:42:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,去把他丢的武器找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go out there and find that weapon he lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.33,0:42:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.74,0:42:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你抛下我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for bailing on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.32,0:42:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,突然有事嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.77,0:42:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.39,0:42:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 有人企图拿它蒸发了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Some guy tried to vaporize me with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.15,0:42:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seriously? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.66,0:42:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,赞啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.27,0:42:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不赞 那人太过分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, not awesome. Totally uncool of that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.58,0:42:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真吓人 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So scary. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.66,0:42:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这是个能源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, look, I think it's a power source.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.14,0:42:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但它连着各种微处理器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it's connected to all these microprocessors.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.96,0:43:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那是感应充电板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an inductive charging plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.40,0:43:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我就用那个给我的牙刷充电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I use to charge my toothbrush.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.13,0:43:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,做这些武器的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever's making these weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.37,0:43:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,显然是结合了外星和人类的科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is obviously combining alien tech with ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.58,0:43:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是史上最酷的一句话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is literally the coolest sentence anyone has ever said.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.52,0:43:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.87,0:43:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,让我加入你的旅途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for letting me be part of your journey
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.73,0:43:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,进入这神奇的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into this amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.67,0:43:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,手指别往刀刃上送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your fingers clear of the blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.03,0:43:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我得查明这玩意是什么 是谁做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta figure out what this thing is and who makes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.21,0:43:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们下课后去实验室做些测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll go to the lab after class and run some tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.26,0:43:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.36,0:43:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我觉得该用质谱仪分析一下发光物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, I said we put the glowy thing in the mass spectrometer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.94,0:43:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我们得想个比"发光物"更好的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, we gotta come up with a better name than "glowy thingy."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.34,0:43:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.88,0:43:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.79,0:43:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.93,0:43:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,高中真让我不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High schools creep me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.09,0:43:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有种奇怪的味儿 知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got this funny smell, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.37,0:43:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那是企图杀我的人之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that's one of the guys that tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.77,0:44:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.41,0:44:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.38,0:44:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.02,0:44:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟上他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.72,0:44:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他们能引我找到把我丢进湖里的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they can lead me to the guy that dropped me in the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.34,0:44:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有人把你丢进了湖里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone dropped you in a lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.32,0:44:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 那滋味可不好受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it was not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.39,0:44:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 彼得 - 不 待在这里 内德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peter... - No. Stay there, Ned.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.23,0:44:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.84,0:44:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.33,0:44:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.76,0:44:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你挺好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.31,0:44:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,下象棋呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.81,0:44:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要是老大知道我们在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, can you imagine what the boss would say
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.33,0:44:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他会怎么说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if he knew where we were?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.68,0:44:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,读数显示这里有能量脉冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's saying there was an energy pulse here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.97,0:44:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但武器不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no sign of the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.53,0:44:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就算之前在 现在也不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even if it was here, now it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.77,0:44:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.03,0:45:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这好赞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.11,0:45:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.15,0:45:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在布鲁克林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.11,0:45:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔顿岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Staten Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.69,0:45:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,离开泽西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.16,0:45:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们停下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.76,0:45:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,马里兰州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maryland?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.89,0:45:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那里有什么 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's there? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.49,0:45:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,邪恶老巢吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evil lair?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.03,0:45:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们有老巢 - 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They have a lair? - Dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.07,0:45:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一个鼓捣外星武器 老大长翅膀的团伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a gang with alien guns run by a guy with wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.91,0:45:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们绝对有老巢啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they have a lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.23,0:45:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.82,0:45:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但你要怎么过去啊 离这儿有300英里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how are you gonna get there if it's, like, 300 miles away?
