Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.27,0:50:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我在某个人身上放了追踪器 他是坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put a tracker on someone. He's a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.44,0:50:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪器已锁定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracker located.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.03,0:50:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拦截目标路线规划中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plotting course to intercept target.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.08,0:50:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好 只要我能在学术竞赛前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, well, as long as I make it back
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.42,0:51:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,赶回来就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in time for decathlon, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.28,0:51:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,距离目的地还有一百米 正在接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hundred meters from destination and closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.56,0:51:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.38,0:51:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,检测到三个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detecting three individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.59,0:51:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的秘密据点竟然在加油站 逊爆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is their secret lair in a gas station? That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.14,0:51:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,战衣姐姐 他们在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suit lady, what are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.00,0:51:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你想听到他们在说什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to hear what they're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.46,0:51:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我能听到他们在说什么 好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hear what they're saying? Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.01,0:51:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,启动强化侦查模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activating enhanced reconnaissance mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.07,0:51:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这铁臂是我在拉各斯清理行动中找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the gauntlet from the Lagos cleanup.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.14,0:51:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 剩下是我自己设计的 - 真酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The rest is my design. - Whoa, that's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.51,0:51:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不敢相信他们还在清理三曲翼(神盾局)总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't believe they're still cleaning the Triskelion mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.85,0:51:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢 他们一直闯祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it. They keep making messes,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.97,0:51:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们就一直有财发 - 目标到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- we keep getting rich. - Target inbound.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.46,0:51:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正在打劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in the middle of a heist.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.26,0:51:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我能抓他们个现行 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could catch 'em all red-handed. This is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.47,0:51:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我要靠近一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm gonna get a little closer
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.72,0:51:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好看清情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I can see what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.07,0:51:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要我启动强化战斗模式吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like me to engage enhanced combat mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.00,0:51:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,强化战斗模式 好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Enhanced combat mode"? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.34,0:52:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,启动击杀功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activating instant kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.12,0:52:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 我不想杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no. I don't want to kill anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.40,0:52:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭击杀功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deactivating instant kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.67,0:52:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们听见了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.63,0:52:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚怎么了 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell just happened? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.95,0:52:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你从招牌上跳了下来 脸冲下落地了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You jumped off the sign and landed on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.51,0:52:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,战衣姐姐 我的射网器怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suit Lady, what's wrong with my web-shooters?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.19,0:52:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,飞射是强化战斗模式的默认模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rapid-fire is the default for enhanced combat mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.77,0:52:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我干吗要飞射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I need rapid-fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.22,0:52:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你想看看更多选项吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to see more options?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.71,0:52:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你共有576种射网选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have 576 possible web-shooter combinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.15,0:52:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生做得太过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark really overdid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.76,0:52:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩等在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.44,0:52:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你最好打开减震器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. You're gonna want to turn on the dampers
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.12,0:52:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,否则那玩意会震碎你的胳膊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or that thing will shatter your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.36,0:52:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 减震器在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, where's the dampers?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.82,0:52:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个 - 选得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That one. - Great choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.98,0:52:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要我把这个设成你的新默认模式吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like me to set this as your new default?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.57,0:52:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不不 - 摁下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no, no. - Push that in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.07,0:52:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里吗 - 不是 另一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right here? - No, the other...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.28,0:52:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个吗 - 对 摁下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This one right here? - Yeah, push it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.63,0:52:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那又是什么 - 电击蛛网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that? - Taser webs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.11,0:52:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,电击蛛网 我不想要电击蛛网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taser webs? I don't want taser webs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.21,0:52:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你似乎对你的射网器设置很不熟悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to be unfamiliar with your web-shooter settings.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.26,0:52:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要进行一次复习课程吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to run a refresher course?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.15,0:52:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 你选吧 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. Just... you choose. - Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.73,0:53:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,6A9 你正点运行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six-Alpha-niner, are you running on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.46,0:53:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 中心 6A9正点运行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy, central. Six-Alpha-niner on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.91,0:53:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我看到了 - 行动 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got a visual. - Green light, green light.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.37,0:53:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.13,0:53:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我看到车队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I got eyes on the convoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.57,0:53:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,正在靠近最后一辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulling in behind the caboose.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.68,0:53:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,下锚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploy anchors.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.42,0:53:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dropping down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.16,0:53:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没有发出求救信号 开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No outgoing distress signals. You're all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.94,0:53:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这里有些好东西啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like they got some good stuff here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.22,0:53:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,酷啊 似乎是某种物质移相器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool. It's like some kind of matter phase shifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.54,0:54:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我上来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.86,0:54:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟 这不是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big bird! This doesn't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.17,0:54:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.20,0:54:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 战衣姐姐 那是什么 - 你叫我选的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Suit Lady, what was that? - You told me to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.88,0:54:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 都设成正常的就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No, just set everything back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.00,0:54:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,启动所有系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activating all systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.04,0:54:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我的头啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My head.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.02,0:54:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你似乎轻微脑震荡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You appear to have a mild concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.31,0:54:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where am I right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.46,0:54:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.15,0:55:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,集装箱壁隔绝了我的传感器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The container walls are hindering my sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.97,0:55:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.48,0:55:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定是劫持了卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have hijacked the truck
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.60,0:55:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把我带回了他们的邪恶老巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and taken me to their evil lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.47,0:55:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 战衣姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Suit Lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.31,0:55:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我们得杀出一条血路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna have to fight our way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.35,0:55:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.80,0:55:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.83,0:55:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,战衣姐姐 我在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suit Lady, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.20,0:55:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你在东海岸最安全的设施内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in the most secure facility on the eastern seaboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.14,0:55:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,损害控制储存库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Damage Control deep storage vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.93,0:55:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.29,0:55:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大门应该是到早上才会开启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door will most likely remain closed until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.07,0:55:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.72,0:55:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,战衣姐姐 我觉得不该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suit Lady, I kind of feel bad
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.77,0:55:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一直喊你"战衣姐姐" 知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}calling you "Suit Lady," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.94,0:55:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我或许该给你起个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I should probably give you a name...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.32,0:55:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,比如丽兹 不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Liz. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.61,0:55:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 那太怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, that's... that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.74,0:55:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,凯伦呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Karen?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.91,0:55:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想 可以喊我凯伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can call me Karen if you would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.77,0:55:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,凯伦 战衣还有什么功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karen, what else can this suit do?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.78,0:56:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.64,0:56:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我们该运行一下复习课程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should run that refresher course.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.06,0:56:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 弹跳蛛网 - 弹跳蛛网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ricochet web. - Ricochet web.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.48,0:56:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.57,0:56:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,分流蛛网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splitter web.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.41,0:56:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蛛网手雷 - 蛛网手雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Web grenade. - Web grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.17,0:56:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我该告诉丽兹我是蜘蛛侠吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I tell Liz that I'm Spider-man?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.96,0:56:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,丽兹是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is Liz?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.31,0:56:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,丽兹是谁 她...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's Liz? She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.07,0:56:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她最棒了 她好赞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the best. She's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.75,0:56:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我们学校的一个姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just a girl who goes to my school.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.59,0:56:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.71,0:56:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很想告诉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I just... I really want to tell her,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.50,0:56:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但这有点怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's kind of weird, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.04,0:56:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"我是蜘蛛侠"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm... I'm Spider-man."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.23,0:56:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这有什么奇怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's weird about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.43,0:56:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要是她以为我会是托尼·斯塔克那样的人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if she's expecting someone like Tony Stark?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.60,0:56:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,等她看到是我 得多失望啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine how disappointed she'd be when she sees me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.79,0:56:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if I were her,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.86,0:56:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我就一点不会失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be disappointed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.57,0:56:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 凯伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.29,0:56:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴有人能聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really nice to have somebody to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.37,0:56:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里待多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long we been here anyways?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.94,0:56:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 37分钟 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thirty-seven minutes. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.04,0:56:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,37分钟 这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-seven minutes? That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.12,0:56:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也受不了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot take this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.37,0:56:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我得出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to... I gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.87,0:57:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这里肯定有什么我能用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's got to be something in here I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.10,0:57:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.57,0:57:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.20,0:57:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个好赞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.18,0:57:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像那个发光物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like the glowy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.64,0:57:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那个发光物是爆炸性齐塔瑞能量核\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That glowy thing is an explosive Chitauri energy core.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.02,0:57:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说我们一直到处带着枚炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, we've been carrying around a bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.91,0:57:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,得有辐射才会让它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would require radiation to transform it
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.39,0:57:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,进入易爆状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into an explosive state.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.85,0:57:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.70,0:57:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 谁来放我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! Please, somebody, let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.52,0:57:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,凯伦 你得帮我超控那个时间锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karen, you have to help me override that time lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.01,0:57:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好 凯伦 降低电压 运行一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Karen, lower the voltage and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.16,0:57:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,试验不成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trial unsuccessful.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.87,0:57:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们只能把所有组合都试一遍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we're just gonna have to try every sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.27,0:57:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 彼得 我们要迟了 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, Peter, we're gonna be late. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.64,0:57:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.56,0:57:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,第247次试验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiating trial 247.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.22,0:57:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了 成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked. It works!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.55,0:58:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,务必关闭所有手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please be sure all cell phones are turned off.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.97,0:58:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.67,0:58:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,凯伦 你得尽快送我去竞赛场地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karen, you have to get me to the decathlon as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.15,0:58:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 告诉我在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure thing. Just tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.28,0:58:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就在华盛顿纪念碑街对面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's right across the street from the Washington Monument.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.12,0:58:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是内德 请留言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Ned. Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.12,0:58:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 给我打电话 那个发光物是炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, call me back! The glowy thing's a bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.69,0:58:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你右边有辆车靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a vehicle approaching on your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.08,0:58:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们进入了赛点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have now entered sudden death.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.43,0:58:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个回答正确者将赢下冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next correct answer wins the championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.88,0:58:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,中城区科技高中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Midtown tech?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.00,0:58:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,０\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.92,0:58:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.43,0:58:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,中城区拿下冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Midtown takes the championship!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.31,0:58:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.05,0:58:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我好为你们骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, I am so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.54,0:58:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就说我们不需要彼得吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you we didn't need Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.79,0:58:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,弗拉士 你一个问题都没答过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flash, you didn't answer a single question.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.84,0:58:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在感受气氛呢 米歇尔 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Taking it all in, Michelle? - Oh, yeah, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.96,0:59:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太想颂扬奴隶建造的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to celebrate something that was built by slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.69,0:59:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,华盛顿纪念碑不会是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure the Washington Monument wasn't built by...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.42,0:59:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.84,0:59:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好好看书吧 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enjoy your book. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.66,0:59:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 内德 你还活着 - 彼得 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ned, you're alive! - Peter, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.97,0:59:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 发光物呢 发光物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, Ned, where's the glowy thing? The glowy thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.95,0:59:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 安全着呢 在我背包里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, it's safe. It's in my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.13,0:59:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 内德 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Ned, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.32,0:59:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 内德 发光物是危险品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, Ned, the glowy thing is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.80,0:59:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你错过了竞赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed the decathlon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.98,0:59:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我替你掩护了 - 内德 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I covered for you. - Ned, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.18,0:59:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在华盛顿纪念碑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're at the Washington Monument...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.65,0:59:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 彼得 是你吗 - 丽兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peter, is that you? - Hey, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.08,0:59:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是丽兹吗 - 请让内德接电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that Liz? - Please, put Ned back on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.78,0:59:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你该把你的感觉告诉她 - 你不见人影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You should tell her how you feel. - You flake!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.35,0:59:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好我们赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so lucky we won.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.02,0:59:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想生你气 但我更加担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I want to be mad, but I'm more worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.90,0:59:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, what is going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.54,0:59:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,丽兹 我得跟内德讲话 真的是要紧事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz, I have to talk to Ned. It's really important!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.38,0:59:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 请把东西都放在传送带上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss, all items on the belt, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.69,0:59:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,丽兹 内德背包里有样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz, there's something in Ned's backpack!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.66,0:59:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,非常危险 千万不能过X光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really dangerous. Don't let it go through an X-ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.52,0:59:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,丽兹 丽兹 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz? Liz! Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.46,0:59:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哈林顿老师 能让我去告诉彼得他被开除了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Harrington, can I be the one to tell Peter he's expelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.00,1:00:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,华盛顿纪念碑高169.29米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Washington Monument is 555 feet, five and one-eighth inches tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.40,1:00:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可以看到大理石和花岗岩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notice how the marble and granite
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.42,1:00:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,沿着石块周围被切开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are cut around the stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.38,1:00:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.00,1:00:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 凯伦 上面什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Karen, what's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.64,1:00:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,齐塔瑞能量核爆炸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chitauri core has detonated
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.77,1:00:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,导致电梯结构严重受损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and caused severe structural damage to the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.32,1:00:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 糟糕 - 我的朋友在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no. - My friends are up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.67,1:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 别担心 女士 一切都会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Don't worry, ma'am, everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.26,1:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,借过 借过 天呐 好高啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, excuse me. Oh, my god, that's tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.48,1:00:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 看天花板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my god. Look at the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.04,1:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,大家冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stay calm, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.94,1:00:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都要死在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are all going to die here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.00,1:00:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,预计10分钟后将发生致命失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Estimating 10 minutes before catastrophic failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.83,1:00:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're freakin' screwed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.93,1:00:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位 我知道那很吓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys, I know that was scary,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.75,1:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们的安全系统还好使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but our safety systems are working.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.80,1:00:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,安全系统已完全失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The safety systems are completely failing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.15,1:00:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're very safe in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.26,1:00:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,电梯内的人面临即刻的死亡威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The occupants are in imminent mortal danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.67,1:00:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经尽快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going as fast as I can!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.82,1:01:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 把手递给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.27,1:01:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,125秒后将发生致命失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You now have 125 seconds until catastrophic failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.53,1:01:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.48,1:01:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,意外动作导致了情况加速恶化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unexpected motion has caused the deterioration to escalate.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.62,1:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I get in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.00,1:01:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,启动侦查无人机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activating reconnaissance drone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.84,1:01:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那个一直在我胸前吗 太赞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has that been there this whole time? That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.54,1:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找最佳进入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locating optimal entry point.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.37,1:01:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,前往西南窗口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed to southwest window.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.07,1:01:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,凯伦 我就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karen, I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.38,1:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里有好多玻璃 - 你行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a lot of glass here. - You got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.66,1:01:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep coming, keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.01,1:01:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.27,1:01:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.45,1:02:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你已经到达西南窗口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong? You've reached the southwest window.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.72,1:02:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么犹豫不前 - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you hesitating? - It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.05,1:02:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是从没爬过这么高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've just never been this high before.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.23,1:02:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你还没有重装你的降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have also not reinstalled your parachute,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.80,1:02:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果从这么高掉下去 很可能会致命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so a fall from this height would most likely be lethal.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.20,1:02:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.90,1:02:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.93,1:02:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它怎么不碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it not breaking?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.04,1:02:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是10厘米厚的防弹玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's four-inch ballistic glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.33,1:02:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你得制造更大的动量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to create more momentum.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.80,1:02:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是特区警察 上报身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is D.C. Metro police. Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.47,1:02:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友在里面呢 快停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends are in there! My friends are in there! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.37,1:02:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻回到地面上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return to the ground immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.14,1:02:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 下一个谁 - 我 到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, who's next? - Me, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.30,1:02:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,弗拉士 不是吧 你干什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flash, seriously? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.54,1:02:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上去吧 - 别管奖杯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Don't worry about the trophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.79,1:03:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.20,1:03:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻回到地面上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return to the ground immediately!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.68,1:03:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,回到地面上 否则我们开火了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return to the ground or we will open fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.20,1:03:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,上去 上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go up, go up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.96,1:03:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.31,1:03:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着我的奖杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take my trophy!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.11,1:03:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你最后的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your last chance!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.62,1:03:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.94,1:03:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.43,1:03:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.96,1:04:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.59,1:04:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 有我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.14,1:04:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.81,1:04:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,大块头 别乱动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big guy, quit moving around.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.70,1:04:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir. So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.56,1:04:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.86,1:04:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.44,1:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈林顿老师 来 - 内德 来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Harrington, go. - Ned, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.62,1:04:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 你们到了 - 来吧 丽兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. This is your stop. - Come on, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.71,1:04:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 都出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go. Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.43,1:04:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,快走啊 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it, people. Move it, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.86,1:04:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定安全吗 - 丽兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure it's safe? - Liz!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.72,1:04:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事 你没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.84,1:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.26,1:04:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my god. - Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.14,1:04:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 各位 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on up. Come on, you guys, stay back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.93,1:04:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 进来 - 没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on in. - You guys good?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.53,1:04:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都没事了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.33,1:04:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你的机会来了 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your chance, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.56,1:04:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,吻她吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiss her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.97,1:05:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.71,1:05:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你真跟彼得·帕克是朋友吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you really friends with Peter Parker?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.14,1:05:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以完成下一单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can finish the next order,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.95,1:05:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有车上的新材料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but without any new materials from that truck...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.64,1:05:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.56,1:05:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有足够物料完成盖根的订单吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still have enough to do the Gargan deal though, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.53,1:05:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 然后就没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but then that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.56,1:05:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我该做高空密封装置了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it is time that I built the high-altitude seal.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.16,1:05:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能不能别再念叨了 - 就那一票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you shut up about that? - It's only one job.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.97,1:05:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.71,1:05:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,八年了 条子毫无动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight years, not a word from the feds,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.52,1:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克塔上那些穿万圣节服装的白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing from those Halloween-costume-wearing bozos
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.20,1:05:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,也没来找过事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}up there in Stark tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.52,1:05:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后突然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.15,1:05:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,冒出这么个穿红紧身衣的小混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this little bastard in red tights shows up
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.51,1:05:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就以为自己能毁掉我所建立的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he thinks he can tear down everything I've built.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.60,1:05:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.23,1:06:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.56,1:06:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要找到他 - 找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna find him... - I found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.74,1:06:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠从天而降 英勇地救下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-man swooped in, heroically saving
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.13,1:06:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一支来自皇后区的学术竞赛队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an academic decathlon team from Queens.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.85,1:06:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这位蒙面英雄的身份仍不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The identity of the masked hero is still unknown.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.73,1:06:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 好了 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom. - Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.39,1:06:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter? Come here, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.01,1:06:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.06,1:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这周末 中城高中学术竞赛队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This past weekend, Midtown's academic decathlon team
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.84,1:06:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,击败了国内翘楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}defeated the country's best
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.27,1:06:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,赢下了全国冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to win the national championship.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.84,1:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,当天晚些时候 他们还战胜了死神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later that day, they also defeated death.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.62,1:06:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸 莎莉叫 弗拉士叫 大家都叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explosion. Sally scream. Flash scream. Everybody scream.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.02,1:06:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,到处是紫激光 还有烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were purple lasers and smoke everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.87,1:06:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,太... 紧张 就像邦·乔维演唱会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was... tight, like a Bon Jovi concert.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.07,1:06:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大家知道 我们活下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know, we made it out alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.65,1:06:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's the important thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.94,1:06:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我可受不了在学校出行期间有学生出事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't bear to lose a student on a school trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.24,1:06:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再来一次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.51,1:06:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好 没人受重伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thankfully, no one was seriously injured,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.81,1:06:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这要多谢蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thanks to the Spider-man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.75,1:06:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 蜘蛛侠 - 谢谢你 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, Spider-man. - Thank you, Spider-man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.70,1:06:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来 蜘蛛侠热横扫全校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up next: The Spider-man mania is sweeping the school.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.81,1:06:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你要如何展现你的蜘蛛精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you show your spider spirit?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.24,1:07:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, dude, dude, dude, dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.48,1:07:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这么出名可大家又都不知道是你 是个什么感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it like being famous when nobody knows it's you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.16,1:07:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好疯狂 哥们 - 真疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Crazy, dude. - It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.76,1:07:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要不要告诉大家 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Should we tell everyone? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.14,1:07:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我要不要告诉大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I tell everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.19,1:07:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 哥们 那可不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, dude. That's not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.11,1:07:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 走 我们上课要迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, come on, we'll be late to class.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.74,1:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不去上课了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to class.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.34,1:07:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你在竞赛时抛弃了我们 已经闯大祸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're already in so much trouble for ditching us at the decathlon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.16,1:07:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 听着 我想明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, listen, I figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.04,1:07:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,翅膀男在偷损害控制的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wingsuit guy is stealing from Damage Control.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.17,1:07:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他把从损害控制偷的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What he takes from Damage Control,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.25,1:07:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,做成武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's how he builds the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.09,1:07:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要抓到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So all I gotta do is catch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.76,1:07:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们还有西班牙语测试呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have a Spanish quiz.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.22,1:07:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 我可能再也不回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, I'm probably never gonna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.79,1:07:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生要把复仇者迁到州北\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark is moving the Avengers upstate
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.37,1:07:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等我抓到这人 - 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- so when I bring this guy in... - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.19,1:07:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你想高中辍学吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to be a high school dropout?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.32,1:07:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,高中现在根本罩不住我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so far beyond high school right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.90,1:07:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,帕克 去我办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker, my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.45,1:07:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.24,1:07:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你被留堂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got detention.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.92,1:07:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你搞砸了 你知道你做错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You screwed up. You know what you did was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.15,1:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 你要如何弥补\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is, how are you gonna make things right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.64,1:07:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你是想扮酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you were trying to be cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.54,1:08:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但听我一个冻了65年的人一句劝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But take it from a guy who's been frozen for 65 years,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.57,1:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真正想酷 就只能遵守规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only way to really be cool is to follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.61,1:08:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都分得清对错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all know what's right. We all know what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.43,1:08:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time those turkeys try to
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.65,1:08:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,想在你面前颠倒黑白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}convince you of something you know is wrong...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.49,1:08:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去哪 回来 - 就想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where you going? Get back here. - Just think to yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.02,1:08:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,美国队长会怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what would Captain America do?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.14,1:08:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你干吗坐这儿 你根本没被留堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here? You don't even have detention.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.33,1:08:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.84,1:08:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是喜欢来这儿 画处于危机中的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just like coming here to sketch people in crisis.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.88,1:08:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.81,1:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体在发生变化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So your body's changing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.30,1:08:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我了解那感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, I know how that feels.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.24,1:08:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.62,1:08:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,凯伦 好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karen. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.62,1:08:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得 你的西班牙语考得怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter. How was your Spanish quiz?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.54,1:08:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 能帮我个忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I was wondering if you could help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.57,1:08:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我想查明那晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to figure out who the guys
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.96,1:08:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,桥下的人的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under the bridge were that night,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.21,1:08:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但我只能记住部分的车牌号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I mean, I can only kinda remember part of a license plate.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.97,1:08:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以用当晚的视频进行面部识别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can run facial recognition on the footage of that encounter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.89,1:09:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 视频 - 是的 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Footage? - Yes, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.69,1:09:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我会记录你看到的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I record everything you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.78,1:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一切 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everything? - Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.82,1:09:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,随时随地吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, all the time?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.64,1:09:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是宝贝监控协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called the Baby-monitor Protocol.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.20,1:09:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.36,1:09:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 倒回上周五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, just roll it back to last Friday.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.57,1:09:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.50,1:09:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好 派对真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone. Yeah, kick-ass party.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.25,1:09:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 丽兹 彼得跟我说过你不少事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up, Liz? Peter's told me a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.99,1:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 这是我胡闹呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. This is just me messing around.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.12,1:09:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快进到当天后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go later in the day, later in the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.14,1:09:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 托尔 奥丁之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is I, Thor, son of Odin!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.60,1:09:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.48,1:09:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那绝不是我们要看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's definitely... that's not what we wanted to watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.86,1:09:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你的模仿非常逗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your impressions are very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.68,1:09:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快进到军火交易那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fast-forward to the arms deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.44,1:09:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.95,1:09:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,右边的俩人 是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The two on the right, who are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.45,1:09:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,搜索执法部门数据库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Searching law enforcement databases.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.47,1:09:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,并未找到这两人的记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No records found for two of the individuals.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.61,1:09:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有吗 - 一人身份确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing? - One individual identified.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.79,1:09:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,艾伦·戴维斯 33岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaron Davis, age 33.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.06,1:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他有犯罪记录 而且就住在皇后区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a criminal record and an address here in Queens.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.95,1:09:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去会会他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's pay him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.51,1:09:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要我启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like me to activate
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.44,1:09:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,强化审讯模式吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the enhanced interrogation protocol?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.44,1:09:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.99,1:10:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,记得我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.68,1:10:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要情报 你得马上给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need information. You're gonna give it to me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.26,1:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 冷静 - 快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, chill. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.67,1:10:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你声音怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to your voice?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.81,1:10:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean what happened to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.31,1:10:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我在桥下听到你说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you by the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.13,1:10:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我认得出那是姑娘的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what a girl sound like.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.47,1:10:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是女的 我是男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a girl! I'm a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.23,1:10:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,男人... 我是男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'm a... I'm a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.57,1:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不管你是男的还是女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what you are, a boy, a girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.66,1:10:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是女的 我是男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a girl! I'm a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.70,1:10:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.36,1:10:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁在出售武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, who is selling these weapons?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.39,1:10:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要知道 告诉我名字 否则我不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know. Give me names or else.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.01,1:10:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你没干过这个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't ever done this before, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.85,1:10:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭审讯模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deactivate interrogation mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.98,1:10:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.56,1:10:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人在售卖非常危险的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these guys are selling weapons that are crazy dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.35,1:10:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不能任它们流入街头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't be out on the streets.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.74,1:10:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有能一下切开达尔摩小店的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If one of them can cut Delmar's bodega in half...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.12,1:10:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你还知道达尔摩的店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know delmar's?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.41,1:10:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 皇后区最好的三明治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, best sandwich in Queens.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.97,1:10:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 三明治港也不错 - 面包太厚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sub Haven's pretty good. - It's too much bread.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.43,1:10:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就喜欢面包 - 拜托了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like bread. - Come on, man, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.77,1:11:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,破审讯模式 凯伦 再也别启用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid interrogation mode. Karen, don't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.79,1:11:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上 你跟那人说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other night, you told that dude,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.86,1:11:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"你想开枪 就冲我来吧"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If you shoot somebody, shoot me."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.56,1:11:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,挺有种的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty ballsy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.08,1:11:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望那种武器进入这一带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want those weapons in this neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.73,1:11:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个侄子住这儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a nephew who live here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.86,1:11:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.29,1:11:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你能跟我讲讲那个长翅膀的男人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can you tell me about the guy with the wings?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.16,1:11:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只知道他是个扮成恶魔的疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other than he's a psychopath dressed like a demon, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.89,1:11:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他是谁 他在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who he is or where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.63,1:11:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道他会去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do know where he's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.28,1:11:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.33,1:11:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我以前合作过的一个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, this crazy dude I used to work with,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.83,1:11:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他要跟那人做笔交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's supposed to be doing a deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.20,1:11:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.43,1:11:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.73,1:11:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没告诉你在哪呢 你都不知道地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't tell you where. You don't have a location.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.21,1:11:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 抱歉 我的错 真傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, of course. Yeah, my bad. Silly. Just...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.97,1:11:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.55,1:11:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪 - 我能提点建议吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is it? - Can I give you some advice?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.38,1:11:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你这部分的能力得加强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to get better at this part of the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.78,1:11:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.56,1:11:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我很吓人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm intimidating.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.99,1:11:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯塔顿岛渡轮 11点 - 那快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Staten Island ferry, 11. - Oh, that's soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.29,1:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那个两小时后就能溶解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's gonna dissolve in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.17,1:11:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 过来给我解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no. Come fix this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.73,1:11:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,两小时 你罪有应得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hours. You deserve that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.88,1:12:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我买了冰淇淋呢 - 这是罪有应得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got ice cream in here. - You deserve that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.02,1:12:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你是罪犯 再见了 罪犯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a criminal. Bye, Mr. Criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.98,1:12:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.36,1:12:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好 凯伦 启动强化侦查模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Karen, activate enhanced reconnaissance mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.30,1:12:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.65,1:12:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他在前面 主甲板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's up front, main deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.03,1:12:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.34,1:12:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是桥下那人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the guy from the bridge, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.13,1:12:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 另一个是谁 - 有情况通知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's that other guy? - Just keep me posted.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.39,1:12:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我在犯罪数据库里找不到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no record of him in my criminal database.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.99,1:12:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,梅·帕克来电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming call from May Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.21,1:12:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,要接到你的显示器上吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I reroute to your heads-up display?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.90,1:12:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在没法接 我回头打回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't talk right now. I'll call her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.01,1:12:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小蛛 去盯着那家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dronie, keep an eye on that guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.29,1:12:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不能让任何人逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let anybody get away this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.72,1:12:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 左边那人是谁 - 麦克·盖根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's the guy on the left? - Mac Gargan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.99,1:13:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有大量案底 包括凶杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extensive criminal record, including homicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.63,1:13:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要我启动击杀功能吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like me to activate instant kill?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.48,1:13:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不 凯伦 别再提击杀功能了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Karen, stop it with the instant kill already.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.04,1:13:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,白色皮卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White pickup truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.71,1:13:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小蛛 在渡轮上搜寻白色皮卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dronie, scan the ship for a white pickup truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.38,1:13:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这也太完美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is too perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.54,1:13:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,武器 买家 卖家 一网打尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got the weapons, buyers and sellers in one place.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.69,1:13:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 托尼·斯塔克来电 - 不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Incoming call from Tony Stark. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.88,1:13:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别接 - 帕克先生 有时间吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't answer. - Mr. Parker. Got a sec?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.58,1:13:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在上学 - 你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm actually at school. - No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.75,1:13:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在华盛顿特区干得漂亮 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice work in D.C. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.12,1:13:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸从来都没怎么支持过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad never really gave me a lot of support
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.06,1:13:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我想打破这个坏循环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm trying to break the cycle of shame.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.82,1:13:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在正在忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm kind of in the middle of something right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.15,1:13:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我夸你的时候别打断我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't cut me off when I'm complimenting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.06,1:14:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 大事将要... 那是什么声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, great things are about to... what is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.10,1:14:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我在乐队排练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm at band practice.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.96,1:14:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怪了 哈皮告诉我你六周前退出乐队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's odd. Happy told me you quit band six weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.04,1:14:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 我得挂了 结束通话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's up? - I gotta go! End call.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.96,1:14:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take those!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.01,1:14:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 非法武器交易的那班渡轮是10点半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys. The illegal weapons-deal ferry was at 10:30.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.61,1:14:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你们错过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.18,1:14:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider guy's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.11,1:14:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.85,1:14:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没事吧 我错了 下手有点重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you guys okay? My bad. That was a little hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.84,1:14:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我得说 另一个人比你用得好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to say, the other guy was way better with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.43,1:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm honestly...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.75,1:14:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,被惊住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... I'm shocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.84,1:15:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不许动 联调局 - 不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Freeze! FBI! - Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.07,1:15:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 趴在地上 - 联调局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get on the ground! - FBI!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.45,1:15:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 联调局 什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. What do you mean, FBI?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.98,1:15:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,联调局全称联邦调查局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The FBI is the Federal Bureau of Investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.55,1:15:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道联调局是什么 但他们来这儿干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what "FBI" means. But what are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.82,1:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.42,1:15:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.34,1:15:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.01,1:15:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快闪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.65,1:15:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 快走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out! Look out! Look out! Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.01,1:15:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 去顶层甲板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move! - Get to the top deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.73,1:15:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.38,1:16:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,启动电击蛛网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate taser web!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.59,1:16:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是在摆弄你不了解的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're messing with things you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.11,1:17:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my god. What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.51,1:17:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,凯伦 X光扫描这艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karen, give me an X-ray of the boat
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.07,1:17:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,标出所有最坚固的点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and target all the strongest points.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.10,1:17:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,蛛网手雷 蛛网手雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Web grenade. Web grenade.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.23,1:17:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,分流蛛网 出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splitter web, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.24,1:17:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 彼得 你成功了98%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great job, Peter. You are 98 percent successful.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.57,1:17:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 98% - 棒啊 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ninety-eight? - Yeah, Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.97,1:18:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.56,1:18:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.42,1:18:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.55,1:18:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.12,1:18:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.92,1:18:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,乐队排练是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Band practice, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.17,1:18:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看 看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.97,1:19:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,棒啊 钢铁侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Iron Man!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.82,1:19:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.05,1:19:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生 我能做什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark, could I do anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.36,1:19:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.28,1:19:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.69,1:19:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样了 你要逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's it? You're just gonna run?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.35,1:19:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,联调局埋伏在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feds were waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.91,1:19:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们又被钢铁侠盯上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we're on Iron Man's radar?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.24,1:19:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我是要逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm running.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.80,1:19:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你也该跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should too.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.63,1:20:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.42,1:20:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.18,1:20:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,梅森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mason,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.54,1:20:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你能及时做好那个高空密封装置吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can you get that high-altitude seal thing up and running in time?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.67,1:20:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.15,1:20:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,能 你不会后悔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. You will not regret this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.74,1:20:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你加入吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You in?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.97,1:20:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,《彼得闯大祸》前情提要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Previously on Peter Screws the Pooch,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.11,1:20:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你别管这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you to stay away from this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.04,1:20:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但你黑进了价值几百万的战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead, you hacked a multimillion-dollar suit
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.98,1:20:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好偷偷背着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you could sneak around behind my back
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.83,1:20:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,做我不让你做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doing the one thing I told you not to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.31,1:20:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.17,1:20:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你没帮上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.50,1:20:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我没帮上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No thanks to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.30,1:20:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那些武器流通在外 我一直想尽办法告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those weapons were out there and I tried to tell you about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.65,1:20:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.35,1:20:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你肯听我的 这些事都不会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of this would've happened if you had just listened to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.96,1:21:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是你真在乎的话 就会亲自来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you even cared, you'd actually be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.59,1:21:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我听了 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did listen, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.63,1:21:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为是谁把联调局叫来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think called the FBI, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.02,1:21:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是唯一一个相信你的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know I was the only one who believed in you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.58,1:21:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人都说我疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone else said I was crazy
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.63,1:21:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 招来个14岁的小孩 - 我15\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- to recruit a 14-year-old kid. - I'm 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.24,1:21:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你把嘴闭严了 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. This is where you zip it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.82,1:21:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大人说话别插嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The adult is talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.10,1:21:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要是今晚有人死了怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if somebody had died tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.73,1:21:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那可就不一样了 对吧 那是你的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Different story, right? 'Cause that's on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.70,1:21:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you died,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.56,1:21:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我会觉得责任在我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like that's on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.23,1:21:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想良心不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need that on my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.39,1:21:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 先生 我很抱歉 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir, I'm sorry. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.64,1:21:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.20,1:21:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起也没用 - 我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry doesn't cut it. - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.42,1:21:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想像你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to be like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.51,1:21:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但我希望你比我强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I wanted you to be better.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.81,1:21:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这样不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, it's not working out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.87,1:21:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我得收回战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need the suit back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.03,1:21:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 收回多久 - 永久收回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For how long? - Forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.61,1:21:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 就是这样 - 不 不 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, that's how it works. - No, no. Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.56,1:21:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快脱吧 - 你不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's have it. - You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.95,1:21:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的一切 没有这套战衣我一无是处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all I have. I'm nothing without this suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.10,1:21:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有这套战衣你就一无是处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're nothing without this suit,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.52,1:21:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就不配拥有它 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you shouldn't have it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.07,1:21:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 我口气跟我爸一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I sound like my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.12,1:21:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我没别的衣服了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have any other clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.82,1:22:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们会想办法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we'll sort that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.13,1:22:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你打了一天电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been calling you all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.85,1:22:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直不接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't answer your phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.57,1:22:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.23,1:22:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,然后渡轮出了事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this ferry thing happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.05,1:22:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我打电话问了五个警局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've called five police stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.88,1:22:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,五个 我还给你五个朋友打了电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five. I called five of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.34,1:22:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我给内德的妈妈打了电话 - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I called Ned's mother. - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.19,1:22:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,梅 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.18,1:22:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 放松 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, just relax. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.77,1:22:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别胡扯了 我知道你逃了留校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the bullshit. I know you left detention.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.79,1:22:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你离开了华盛顿的酒店房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you left the hotel room in Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.48,1:22:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你每天晚上都从家偷溜出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you sneak out of this house every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.65,1:22:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.92,1:22:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得 你得告诉我到底怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, you have to tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.30,1:22:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来吧 这里只有我们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just lay it out. It's just me and you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.78,1:22:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我丢了在斯塔克的实习工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost the Stark internship.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.96,1:22:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.12,1:22:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.72,1:23:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是以为我可以努力工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought that I could work really hard
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.55,1:23:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他就会... 就会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he could... he would... you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.44,1:23:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是... 我搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... I screwed it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.08,1:23:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.70,1:23:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.20,1:23:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我让你担心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I made you worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.75,1:23:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白我并不是想毁掉你的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm not trying to ruin your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.76,1:23:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.12,1:23:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,只是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.74,1:23:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我以前也会偷溜出去 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I used to sneak out too. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.10,1:23:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,洗个澡吧 你臭死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And take a shower. You smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.07,1:23:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你身上一股... 垃圾味儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You smell like... you smell like garbage.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.53,1:23:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.26,1:23:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得 你是个好孩子 聪明的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, you're a good kid and you're a smart kid,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.49,1:23:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 把精神用在正地方 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so just try to keep your head straight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.99,1:23:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.50,1:23:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.25,1:23:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是被开除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you expelled?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.55,1:23:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是要去46街那个高中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have to go to that school on 46th
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.70,1:23:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们校长有把十字弩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where their principal has a crossbow?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.75,1:23:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那八成只是街头传闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty sure that's an urban myth,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.86,1:23:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我没有被开除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, no, I'm not expelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.60,1:24:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你真走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.07,1:24:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 帕克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Muy bueno, senor Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.23,1:24:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你第五节课要上微积分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you had calculus fifth period.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.86,1:24:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我只是在做返校节的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I was just doing some homecoming stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.39,1:24:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.99,1:25:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我想为学术竞赛的事道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to apologize about the whole decathlon thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.49,1:25:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没关系 - 真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's fine. - Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.09,1:25:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,上周 学术竞赛是最重要的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last week, decathlon was the most important thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.44,1:25:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但接着 我死里逃生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but then I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.47,1:25:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我只是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I just... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.43,1:25:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just mean that
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.94,1:25:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那样很不好 尤其...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was not cool, especially...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.39,1:25:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,因为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.25,1:25:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.35,1:25:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.64,1:25:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.17,1:25:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你太不会保密了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're terrible at keeping secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.45,1:25:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这你就不知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.35,1:25:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去上课了 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to get to class, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.07,1:25:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说我们应该一起聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say we should hang out,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.54,1:25:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我还要留校...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm gonna be in detention for...
