Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.61,1:31:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在地面上看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it all from the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.27,1:31:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.79,1:31:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还好他那天在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very lucky that he was there that day.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.38,1:31:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好伙计蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good old spider-man.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.66,1:32:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 绿灯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.92,1:32:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了 到地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are. End of the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.19,1:32:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.17,1:32:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你先进去吧 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You head in there, gumdrop.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.76,1:32:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我要给彼得来一场"父亲训话"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna give Peter the "Dad" talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.49,1:32:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别被他吓到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him intimidate you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.67,1:32:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.93,1:32:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爱你 宝贝 - 一路顺风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Love you, gumdrop. - Have a safe flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.73,1:32:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看上去真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys look so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.14,1:32:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does she know?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.10,1:32:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,知道什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.76,1:32:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那么她不知道 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So she doesn't. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.44,1:32:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,会保守秘密 这点我很钦佩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close to the vest. I admire that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.72,1:32:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己也有一些秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a few secrets of my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.45,1:32:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我有那么多理由反对我女儿约会 到头来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all the reasons i didn't want my daughter to date...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.34,1:33:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.07,1:33:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么比家庭更重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing is more important than family.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.44,1:33:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你救了我女儿的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved my daughter's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.32,1:33:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会忘记这种恩情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could never forget something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.27,1:33:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我给你一个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm gonna give you one chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.44,1:33:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.16,1:33:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你走进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You walk through those doors,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.31,1:33:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,忘掉这些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you forget any of this happened
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.52,1:33:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and don't you ever,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.55,1:33:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.09,1:33:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,插手我的生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}interfere with my business again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.84,1:33:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,否则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause if you do,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.03,1:33:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.36,1:33:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,和你爱的每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and everybody you love.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.17,1:33:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我会要你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.84,1:33:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我为了保护家人能做出的事 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'll do to protect my family, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.29,1:33:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.63,1:33:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚救了你的命 你该怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saved your life. Now what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.23,1:33:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.70,1:33:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.66,1:33:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you go on in there,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.95,1:33:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,让我女儿好好开心一下 知道了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you show my daughter a good time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.96,1:33:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也别太开心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just not too good.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.04,1:34:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他和你说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.82,1:35:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.07,1:35:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.09,1:35:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这对你不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.35,1:35:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他给了你选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.98,1:35:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你选错了 - 搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You chose wrong. - What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.00,1:35:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这破烂衣服是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with the crappy costume?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.09,1:35:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的射网器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My web-shooters.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.46,1:35:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来还对这玩意抱有怀疑 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't sure about this thing at first, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.99,1:35:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.28,1:35:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.04,1:36:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他为什么派你来 - 你永远不会知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why did he send you here? - Guess you'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.95,1:36:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.64,1:36:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.68,1:36:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 那个有翅膀的家伙是丽兹的爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, the guy with the wings is Liz's dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.07,1:36:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我知道 我得告诉斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I know. I gotta tell Mr. Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.84,1:36:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,联系哈皮·霍根 他是斯塔克先生的安保主管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call Happy Hogan. He's Mr. Stark's head of security.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.35,1:36:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,去找一台电脑 帮我追踪我的手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And get a computer and track my phone for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.55,1:36:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.26,1:36:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们得在他出城前抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, we gotta catch him before he leaves town.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.85,1:36:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,晚餐的事我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about dinner, but
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.49,1:36:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道新鲜柠檬鲈鱼什么味儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know when branzino's fresh,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.73,1:36:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那绝对不新鲜 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that was not fresh, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.35,1:36:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.05,1:36:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,弗拉士 我需要你的车和你的手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flash, I need your car and your phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.10,1:36:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 严格来说这是我爸的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, technically, this is my dad's car, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.38,1:36:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I can't...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.41,1:37:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 你听得到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Ned? Hey, hey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.48,1:37:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是内德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for Ned.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.89,1:37:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 我需要你帮我追踪我的手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, I need you to track my phone for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.05,1:37:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好 但你的手机在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.03,1:37:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太聪明了 他刚刚经过杰克逊大道的游戏站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius move. Okay, he just passed the gamestop on Jackson Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.92,1:37:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意的前灯怎么开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the headlights on this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.52,1:37:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在开弗拉士的车 - 我来查操作说明书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm in Flash's car. - I'll pull the specs.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.04,1:37:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 给你开免提了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you're on speakerphone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.32,1:37:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你偷了弗拉士的车 赞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stole Flash's car? Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.29,1:37:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 很赞 很...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's awesome! It's awe...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.75,1:37:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,让开 让开 快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way! Get out of the way! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.99,1:37:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 彼得 你没事吧 - 我从来没开过车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peter, are you okay? - I've never driven before.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.06,1:37:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就和梅在停车场练过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only with May in parking lots.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.47,1:37:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这跨度也太大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a huge step up.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.55,1:37:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你联系到哈皮了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you gotten through to Happy yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.12,1:37:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我正在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.11,1:37:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我得攻破手机系统的后门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just gotta backdoor the phone system.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.90,1:37:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,技术支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy in the chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.47,1:37:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,九分钟后起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Takeoff in nine minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.06,1:37:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 喂 谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Hello? Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.19,1:37:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈皮先生 我是内德 - 谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Happy, it's Ned. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.66,1:37:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我是彼得·帕克的同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an associate of Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.98,1:37:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有很重要的事要和你说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got something important to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.16,1:37:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你在逗我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be shitting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.72,1:37:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.55,1:38:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 搞清楚前灯怎么用了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, how we coming with those headlights?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.71,1:38:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,方向盘左边的圆形把手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Round knob to the left of the steering wheel,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.77,1:38:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 顺时针转 - 左边 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- turn clockwise. - Left, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.05,1:38:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,完美 我的手机现在在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, perfect. So where's my phone now?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.35,1:38:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他停在了布鲁克林一家旧工业园区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stopped in an old industrial park in Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.14,1:38:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 那没道理啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? That makes no sense!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.55,1:38:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为他说他要出城了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought he said he was going out of town!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.21,1:38:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真奇怪 我联系到了哈皮先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weird. Oh, I reached Mr. Happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.27,1:38:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像不是很喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think he likes you, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.53,1:38:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像正忙着赶飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounded like he was catching a flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.24,1:38:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么九分钟后起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said something about taking off in nine minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.10,1:38:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 他边上都是箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - He was surrounded by boxes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.02,1:38:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,箱子 今天是搬家日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boxes? It's moving day.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.82,1:38:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是搬家日 搬家日 他要劫那架飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's moving day. It's moving day. He's gonna rob that plane.
