Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.80,1:39:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很荣幸 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been an honor, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.10,1:39:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么 在举办舞会呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here? There's a dance.
