Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.74,1:40:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.76,1:40:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter,
