Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.51,2:00:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你能很好融入的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll fit right in.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.82,2:00:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Stark,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.27,2:00:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 还是不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm... I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.63,2:00:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了 怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're good? How are you good?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.43,2:00:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.79,2:00:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是想再多脚踏实地一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather just stay on the ground for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.67,2:00:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,做个友善的好街坊蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friendly neighborhood Spider-man.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.15,2:00:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,总得有人去照顾小人物嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's got to look out for the little guy, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.32,2:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你要拒绝我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're turning me down?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.03,2:00:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你想清楚了 看那个啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better think about this. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.26,2:00:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.30,2:00:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,最后机会 要不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last chance. Yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.33,2:00:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.86,2:00:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这种斯普林斯汀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kind of a Springsteen-y,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.03,2:00:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,工人阶级英雄的气概我还蛮喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}working-class hero vibe that I dig.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.61,2:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哈皮会送你回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy will take you home.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.83,2:00:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行吧 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.49,2:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,能去车里等着吗 我需要点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind waiting in the car? I need a minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.18,2:00:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Stark.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.99,2:00:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不客气 帕克先生 那好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Mr. Parker, very well.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.72,2:00:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回见 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you around. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.94,2:01:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚是试我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a test, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.96,2:01:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那后面根本没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nobody back there?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.23,2:01:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你通过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you passed.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.33,2:01:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, skedaddle there,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.65,2:01:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 斯塔克先生 谢谢 - 小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, Mr. Stark. Thank you. - young buck.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.26,2:01:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.90,2:01:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就说他是个好孩子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you he was a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.23,2:01:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,派珀 派珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pepper! Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.27,2:01:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the kid?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.07,2:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他走了 - 大家都等着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He left. - Everybody's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.58,2:01:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 他做了个很成熟的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, he actually made a really mature choice.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.96,2:01:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就是让我们措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just surprised the heck out of us.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.49,2:01:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们搞砸了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you guys screw this up?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.98,2:01:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫那孩子去车里等着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told the kid to go wait in the car.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.23,2:01:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑 那一屋子的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me? I have a room full of people
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.00,2:01:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,都在等待一个重大消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they're waiting for some big announcement.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.41,2:01:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟他们说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I gonna tell them?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.55,2:01:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,想点别的吧 比如\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of something. How about, um,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.76,2:01:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哈皮 戒指你还带着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hap, you still got that ring?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.03,2:01:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I... I...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.96,2:01:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 订婚戒指 - 开玩笑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- the engagement ring. - Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.40,2:01:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我从2008年带到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been carrying this since 2008.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.36,2:01:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.63,2:01:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我能想到比那个好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can think of something better than that.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.31,2:01:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这能给我们争取点时间嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it would buy us a little time.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.88,2:01:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也不需要时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like we need time.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.25,2:02:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你把那玩意就揣兜里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you have that thing in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.01,2:02:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要我替你开门吗 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me to get the door for you, hon?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.97,2:02:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.63,2:02:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,梅婶婶 你做晚饭了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt May, did you do dinner already?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.53,2:02:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.11,2:02:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the f...?!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.22,2:05:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.97,2:05:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,多巧啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are the odds
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.84,2:05:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,咱俩进了同一个夏令营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and I'd end up at the same summer camp?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.40,2:05:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.27,2:05:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这 不怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This? It's not on you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.44,2:05:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要怪我们那位蜘蛛小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on our little spider friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.70,2:05:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我在外面有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got some boys on the outside
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.29,2:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很想认识认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who would love to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.22,2:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,拍张合照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, take a picture,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.72,2:05:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,割了他的喉咙 把他脑袋塞进烘干机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}slice his throat, put his head in a dryer.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.43,2:05:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到传闻说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I heard a rumor...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.94,2:05:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.27,2:05:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I knew who he was,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.82,2:05:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他早就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'd already be dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.89,2:05:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,图姆斯 你的家人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toomes, your family's here!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.94,2:12:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我是美国队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Captain America,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.25,2:12:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟你们谈谈 一名士兵或学生能拥有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here to talk to you about one of the most valuable traits
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.49,2:12:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,最宝贵的品质之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a soldier or student can have.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:41.05,2:12:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.87,2:12:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有时 耐心能换来胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes patience is the key to victory.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:45.15,2:12:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有时 却回报甚少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes it leads to very little
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.41,2:12:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,会让人觉得很不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it seems like it's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.86,2:12:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你会想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you wonder
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.58,2:12:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,当初何必等那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why you waited so long
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.76,2:12:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,盼来的却是失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for something so disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.10,2:13:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意还要拍几条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many more of these?
